  "title": "Tasmania LIST open data, cloud-ready",
  "description": "Every statewide dataset from the LIST (Tasmania) open data bulk downloads, as GeoParquet and Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF on Source Cooperative, read in place over HTTPS or S3. Where LIST ships a product only as 29 per-LGA zips, the statewide file is built from them, with features clipped at LGA boundaries rejoined. 325 products in 14 themes. Data (c) State of Tasmania, CC BY 3.0 AU.",
